{"id":767,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Wimpod gather in swarms, constantly on the lookout for danger. They scatter the moment they detect an enemy’s presence."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It’s nature’s cleaner—it eats anything and everything, including garbage and rotten things. The ground near its nest is always clean."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"An astonishingly cowardly Pokémon, Wimpod will whir its legs at high speeds to run away if anything comes near it."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It will pick up anything it finds on the ground. Sometimes it finds coins, so Murkrow and Meowth will go after it."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Its habitat varies from beaches to seabeds. A natural scavenger, it will gleefully chow down on anything edible, no matter how rotten."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"This Pokémon is a coward. As it desperately dashes off, the flailing of its many legs leaves a sparkling clean path in its wake."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Wimp Out","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon cowardly switches out when its HP becomes half or less."}],"eggGroups":["Bug","Water 3"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Tentacles","evolution":{"id":767,"name":"Wimpod","condition":null,"children":[{"id":768,"name":"Golisopod","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,28],[1,111],[1,522]],"machine":[372,213,405,203,263,258,141,341,182,240,156,496,503,103,214,173,191,164,57,129,269,127],"egg":[453,106,232,205,469],"tutor":[806]},"cards":[{"id":"sv4-191","name":"Wimpod","set":"Paradox Rift","date":"2023-11-03","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"191","artist":"Oku","img":"sv4/191"},{"id":"me4-25","name":"Wimpod","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Common","number":"25","artist":"0313","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-25/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-25/large"},{"id":"sv4-47","name":"Wim